  "platform": "Xbox 360",
  "detector": "bully",
  "trackingNote": "The plugin reads your newest save in Documents\\Bully Scholarship Edition (BullyFile1-6) when the game saves. The five chapter achievements unlock from the save's chapter, Perfectionist at 100% on the load screen, Mission Accomplished when the game marks every mission passed, the class achievements from how many classes you have finished all five levels of, The Champion from the 14 bike races, and the counter achievements (distances, eggs, wedgies, taunts, knockouts, sodas, bottles, room trophies, bikes jacked and more) from the game's own Stats screen numbers, which show here as n / total. Errands, go-kart races, jobs, kisses and carnival or arcade achievements are marked by hand for now.",
  "setupHint": "Save in Bully, or select a BullyFile save in Settings.",
